      ],
      "text": "When the gourd leshy witch dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from their body, restoring 4d8 healing,vitality Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30-foot emanation. This area immediately fills with gourds, becoming difficult terrain. If the terrain is not a viable environment for these plants, they wither after 24 hours."
